senses.gloss:
शिथिल śithilá, a. loose, slackened, unfastened, 🞄drooping;
 supple;
 unstable, tremulous;
 🞄languid, feeble;
 careless in (lc.): -m, ad. tottering 🞄(stand): (a) -tā, f. slackness: -ṃ gam 🞄or vraj, be neglected.

शिथिलीकृ śithilī-kṛ, loosen, relax;
 diminish, 🞄alleviate: pp. loosened, etc.;
 -bhū, become 🞄relaxed, relax oneʼs efforts;
 desist from (ab.).
